<title>USA: Protein Design, Roche in deal.</title>
<headline>Protein Design, Roche in deal.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Protein Design Labs Inc said it signed an agreement to humanize a mouse monoclonal antibody for Hoffman-La Roche Inc.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, Roche will have a non-exclusive license to develop and commercialize the humanized antibody. Protein Design will receive an undisclosed fee and may earn an additional milestone payment.</p>
<p>Protein Design said the antibody &quot;represents a new approach to potentially treating rheumatoid arthritis and other auto-immune conditions.&quot;</p>
<p>The deal is Protein Design's second with Hoffman-La Roche.</p>
</text>
